     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ものだ: general truth or feeling",
     "texto": [
      "It can express a general observation or an emotion: plain-form sentence + **ものだ**: **こども は すぐ おおきく なる もの だ** (children grow up quickly; that's natural).",
      "With **Vたものだ** you also recall past habits; context distinguishes these uses."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Difference with 〜のです",
     "texto": [
      "In **ものだ**, the speaker presents a generalisation, a memory or an emotion; **のです** usually explains or puts a concrete situation in context. They aren't interchangeable in every case."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
